sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as 🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Patient
    participant PP as 📱 Patient Portal
    participant AI as 🤖 Gemini AI
    participant DB as 🗄️ Database
    participant DP as 💻 Doctor Portal
    participant D as 👨‍⚕️ Doctor
    participant MS as 📹 Meeting Server

    rect rgb(227, 242, 253)
        Note over P,AI: 📝 SYMPTOM COLLECTION & AI TRIAGE
        P->>PP: Enter symptoms
        PP->>AI: Analyze symptoms
        AI-->>PP: Suggested specialty + urgency
        PP->>P: Show recommended doctors
    end

    rect rgb(232, 245, 233)
        Note over P,DB: 📅 BOOKING PROCESS
        P->>PP: Select doctor & time slot
        PP->>DB: Check availability
        DB-->>PP: Slot available
        PP->>DB: Create appointment (status: pending)
        PP->>P: Booking confirmation
    end

    rect rgb(255, 243, 224)
        Note over DB,D: ✅ DOCTOR CONFIRMATION & POOL
        DB->>DP: New appointment notification
        DP->>D: Show pending / pool (includeAccepted)
        D->>DP: Confirm from pool
        DP->>DB: UPDATE status confirmed (row kept, acceptedBy)
        Note over DB,DP: Accepted visible 7 days · decline → in_pool
        DB->>PP: Status update
        PP->>P: Email notification
    end

    rect rgb(224, 247, 250)
        Note over P,MS: 📹 VIDEO CONSULTATION
        P->>PP: Join meeting (at scheduled time)
        D->>DP: Join meeting
        PP->>MS: Request room (JWT auth)
        DP->>MS: Request room (JWT auth)
        MS-->>PP: Jitsi room URL
        MS-->>DP: Jitsi room URL
        P->>MS: Connect to video call
        D->>MS: Connect to video call
        MS->>MS: Real-time transcription
    end

    rect rgb(243, 229, 245)
        Note over D,DB: 📋 POST-CONSULTATION
        MS-->>DP: Transcript + AI summary
        D->>DP: Complete SOAP notes
        D->>DP: E-prescription
        D->>DP: Sign record
        DP->>DB: Save encounter & prescription
        DB->>PP: Records available
        PP->>P: Notification: records ready
    end
